@startuml
!theme plain

box "System Value" #E3F2FD
actor "👤 Administrator" as Admin
actor "👤 Customer" as Customer
end box
box "System Boundary" #E0F7FA
boundary "🖥️ Address Selection Screen" as AddressSelectScreen
boundary "🖥️ Cart Screen" as CartScreen
boundary "🖥️ Order Complete Screen" as OrderCompleteScreen
boundary "🖥️ Order Confirmation Screen" as OrderConfirmScreen
boundary "🖥️ Order History Screen" as OrderHistoryScreen
boundary "🖥️ Payment Information Screen" as PaymentInputScreen
boundary "🖥️ Payment Result Screen" as PaymentResultScreen
boundary "🖥️ Product Detail Screen" as ProductDetailScreen
boundary "🖥️ Product Search Screen" as ProductSearchScreen
end box
box "System" #F3E5F5
participant "🧩 システム" as System
control "🔌 Add To Cart API" as AddToCartApi
control "🔌 Cancel Order API" as CancelOrderApi
control "🔌 Confirm Order API" as ConfirmOrderApi
control "🔌 Order History API" as OrderHistoryApi
control "🔌 Payment Authorization API" as PaymentAuthorizationApi
control "🔌 Payment Capture API" as PaymentCaptureApi
control "🔌 Payment Input API" as PaymentInputApi
control "🔌 Payment Refund API" as PaymentRefundApi
control "🔌 Place Order API" as PlaceOrderApi
control "🔌 Product Detail API" as ProductDetailApi
control "🔌 Product Search API" as ProductSearchApi
control "🔌 Remove Cart Item API" as RemoveCartItemApi
control "🔌 Select Address API" as SelectAddressApi
control "🔌 Update Cart Item API" as UpdateCartItemApi
control "🔌 View Cart API" as ViewCartApi
database "🗄️ Cart" as Cart
database "🗄️ Cart Item" as CartItem
database "🗄️ Category" as Category
database "🗄️ Order" as Order
database "🗄️ Order Line" as OrderLine
database "🗄️ Payment" as Payment
database "🗄️ Product" as Product
database "🗄️ Shipping Address" as ShippingAddress
end box

== ✅ Add to Cart ==
Customer -> CartScreen : ✅ Add to Cart
CartScreen -> AddToCartApi : ✅ Add to Cart
activate AddToCartApi
AddToCartApi -> Product : read
group transaction (API atomic boundary)
AddToCartApi -> Cart : update
AddToCartApi -> CartItem : create
end
AddToCartApi --> CartScreen : 🖥️ Cart Screen
CartScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Cart Screen
deactivate AddToCartApi

== ✅ Authorize Payment ==
Customer -> PaymentResultScreen : ✅ Authorize Payment
PaymentResultScreen -> PaymentAuthorizationApi : ✅ Authorize Payment
activate PaymentAuthorizationApi
PaymentAuthorizationApi -> Payment : update
PaymentAuthorizationApi --> PaymentResultScreen : 🖥️ Payment Result Screen
PaymentResultScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Payment Result Screen
deactivate PaymentAuthorizationApi

== ✅ Cancel Order ==
Customer -> OrderHistoryScreen : ✅ Cancel Order
OrderHistoryScreen -> CancelOrderApi : ✅ Cancel Order
activate CancelOrderApi
CancelOrderApi -> Order : update
CancelOrderApi --> OrderHistoryScreen : 🖥️ Order History Screen
OrderHistoryScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Order History Screen
deactivate CancelOrderApi

== ✅ Capture Payment ==
Customer -> PaymentResultScreen : ✅ Capture Payment
PaymentResultScreen -> PaymentCaptureApi : ✅ Capture Payment
activate PaymentCaptureApi
group transaction (API atomic boundary)
PaymentCaptureApi -> Order : update
PaymentCaptureApi -> Payment : update
end
PaymentCaptureApi --> PaymentResultScreen : 🖥️ Payment Result Screen
PaymentResultScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Payment Result Screen
deactivate PaymentCaptureApi

== ✅ Confirm Order Details ==
Customer -> OrderConfirmScreen : ✅ Confirm Order Details
OrderConfirmScreen -> ConfirmOrderApi : ✅ Confirm Order Details
activate ConfirmOrderApi
ConfirmOrderApi -> Cart : read
ConfirmOrderApi -> CartItem : read
ConfirmOrderApi -> ShippingAddress : read
ConfirmOrderApi --> OrderConfirmScreen : 🖥️ Order Confirmation Screen
OrderConfirmScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Order Confirmation Screen
deactivate ConfirmOrderApi

== ✅ Confirm Delivery ==
Admin -> System : ✅ Confirm Delivery
activate System
System -> Order : update
deactivate System

== ✅ Enter Payment Information ==
Customer -> PaymentInputScreen : ✅ Enter Payment Information
PaymentInputScreen -> PaymentInputApi : ✅ Enter Payment Information
activate PaymentInputApi
PaymentInputApi -> Order : read
PaymentInputApi -> Payment : create
PaymentInputApi --> PaymentInputScreen : 🖥️ Payment Information Screen
PaymentInputScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Payment Information Screen
deactivate PaymentInputApi

== ✅ Place Order ==
Customer -> OrderCompleteScreen : ✅ Place Order
OrderCompleteScreen -> PlaceOrderApi : ✅ Place Order
activate PlaceOrderApi
group transaction (API atomic boundary)
PlaceOrderApi -> Cart : update
PlaceOrderApi -> Order : create
PlaceOrderApi -> OrderLine : create
end
PlaceOrderApi --> OrderCompleteScreen : 🖥️ Order Complete Screen
OrderCompleteScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Order Complete Screen
deactivate PlaceOrderApi

== ✅ Refund Payment ==
Customer -> PaymentResultScreen : ✅ Refund Payment
PaymentResultScreen -> PaymentRefundApi : ✅ Refund Payment
activate PaymentRefundApi
group transaction (API atomic boundary)
PaymentRefundApi -> Order : update
PaymentRefundApi -> Payment : update
end
PaymentRefundApi --> PaymentResultScreen : 🖥️ Payment Result Screen
PaymentResultScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Payment Result Screen
deactivate PaymentRefundApi

== ✅ Remove from Cart ==
Customer -> CartScreen : ✅ Remove from Cart
CartScreen -> RemoveCartItemApi : ✅ Remove from Cart
activate RemoveCartItemApi
RemoveCartItemApi -> CartItem : delete
RemoveCartItemApi --> CartScreen : 🖥️ Cart Screen
CartScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Cart Screen
deactivate RemoveCartItemApi

== ✅ Search Products ==
Customer -> ProductSearchScreen : ✅ Search Products
ProductSearchScreen -> ProductSearchApi : ✅ Search Products
activate ProductSearchApi
ProductSearchApi -> Product : read
ProductSearchApi -> Category : read
ProductSearchApi --> ProductSearchScreen : 🖥️ Product Search Screen
ProductSearchScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Product Search Screen
deactivate ProductSearchApi

== ✅ Select Shipping Address ==
Customer -> AddressSelectScreen : ✅ Select Shipping Address
AddressSelectScreen -> SelectAddressApi : ✅ Select Shipping Address
activate SelectAddressApi
SelectAddressApi -> ShippingAddress : read
SelectAddressApi --> AddressSelectScreen : 🖥️ Address Selection Screen
AddressSelectScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Address Selection Screen
deactivate SelectAddressApi

== ✅ Ship Order ==
Admin -> System : ✅ Ship Order
activate System
System -> Order : update
deactivate System

== ✅ Change Cart Item Quantity ==
Customer -> CartScreen : ✅ Change Cart Item Quantity
CartScreen -> UpdateCartItemApi : ✅ Change Cart Item Quantity
activate UpdateCartItemApi
UpdateCartItemApi -> CartItem : update
UpdateCartItemApi --> CartScreen : 🖥️ Cart Screen
CartScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Cart Screen
deactivate UpdateCartItemApi

== ✅ View Cart ==
Customer -> CartScreen : ✅ View Cart
CartScreen -> ViewCartApi : ✅ View Cart
activate ViewCartApi
ViewCartApi -> Cart : read
ViewCartApi -> CartItem : read
ViewCartApi -> Product : read
ViewCartApi --> CartScreen : 🖥️ Cart Screen
CartScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Cart Screen
deactivate ViewCartApi

== ✅ View Order History ==
Customer -> OrderHistoryScreen : ✅ View Order History
OrderHistoryScreen -> OrderHistoryApi : ✅ View Order History
activate OrderHistoryApi
OrderHistoryApi -> Order : read
OrderHistoryApi -> OrderLine : read
OrderHistoryApi --> OrderHistoryScreen : 🖥️ Order History Screen
OrderHistoryScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Order History Screen
deactivate OrderHistoryApi

== ✅ View Product Details ==
Customer -> ProductDetailScreen : ✅ View Product Details
ProductDetailScreen -> ProductDetailApi : ✅ View Product Details
activate ProductDetailApi
ProductDetailApi -> Product : read
ProductDetailApi --> ProductDetailScreen : 🖥️ Product Detail Screen
ProductDetailScreen --> Customer : 🖥️ Product Detail Screen
deactivate ProductDetailApi

@enduml
